  "title": "Easy Baked Chicken Wings",
  "description": "Dip those wings in egg and flour, then pour a basic soy sauce, sugar and vinegar sauce over them and bake to completion. Good to take to a potluck dinner.",
  "authors": [
    "Lynn"
  ],
  "date_published": "2020-06-18T23:06:06-04:00",
